              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Debbie Sue"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've been making this recipe for years. The only change I make is that I always use thawed shrimp and not ones from a can. It is always everyone's favourite at parties and I am not always asked to bring it at every get together. It's also great the next day, if you ever have any leftover!",
